osts:","value":"2081"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-02T08:29:42-07:00","id":466143,"title":"","content":"Yes. That was tricky, and fa\u00e7ade. I've no idea if I caught any of the place names, though I thought Tchud might make a good origin story for CHUD, and only managed to catch one misspelling of a character name. Plus there's a lot of words that are technically incorrect in American English, but just fine in British English. Advertize threw me, apparently people think it's the American way of spelling it, but I and others who responded to those posts have never seen it spelled that way. There's a lot of words that technically need a space or hyphen between them, but I skipped over them because it just seemed to be the way things were written in the books.<br /> <br /> Apparently Tataouine is a real place and Star Wars just took the name.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 04-02-2015, 11:33 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-02T09:57:34-07:00","id":466247,"title":"","content":"Page 128: &quot;..including two of her Sadikh&quot; An Arisen can have only one Sadikh at a time,","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4055-felipe","name":"Felipe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4055_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"538"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-04T10:57:21-07:00","id":468515,"title":"","cont